{%- liquid
  assign s = section.settings
  assign kn_qa_title = s.quick_add_title
  if kn_qa_title == blank
    if request.locale.iso_code == 'fr'
      assign kn_qa_title = 'Ajout rapide'
    else
      assign kn_qa_title = 'Quick add'
    endif
  endif
  assign kn_qa_add = 'actions.add_to_cart' | t
  assign kn_qa_add = s.quick_add_label | default: kn_qa_add
  assign kn_qa_sold = 'products.product.sold_out' | t
  assign kn_qa_sold = s.quick_add_sold_out | default: kn_qa_sold
  assign kn_qa_close = 'actions.close' | t
  assign kn_qa_close = s.quick_add_close | default: kn_qa_close
  assign target_collection = s.collection
  assign kn_products = target_collection.products
  assign kn_link_url = target_collection.url

  comment
    Sans collection choisie, la section montre les dernières pièces créées,
    de la plus récente à la plus ancienne, et son lien ouvre la même liste
    dans le même ordre. L'ordre par défaut de « tous les produits » est
    alphabétique : une section intitulée Nouveautés s'ouvrait sur la lettre B.
  endcomment
  if target_collection == blank
    assign target_collection = collections.all
    assign kn_products = collections.all.products | sort: 'created_at' | reverse
    assign kn_link_url = routes.all_products_collection_url | append: '?sort_by=created-descending'
  endif
  assign product_count = target_collection.products.size
  assign show_link = false
  if s.link_label != blank and kn_link_url != blank
    assign show_link = true
  endif
-%}

<div class="kn-section" data-kn-surface="light">
  <div class="kn-container">
    <div class="kn-home-head">
      <h2 class="kn-home-head__title">{{ s.title | escape }}</h2>
      {%- if show_link -%}
        <a class="kn-label kn-underline kn-home-head__link" href="{{ kn_link_url }}">
          {{- s.link_label | escape -}}
        </a>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>

    {%- if product_count > 0 -%}
      <div class="kn-products__grid kn-home-body">
        {%- for product in kn_products limit: s.count -%}
          <div class="kn-reveal kn-qa">
            {%- render 'kn-product-card', product: product -%}
            {%- comment -%}
              Ajout rapide : le bouton rond se pose sur le coin bas droit de la
              photo. Le cadre transparent reprend le format de l'image pour
              que le bouton suive la photo à toutes les largeurs.
            {%- endcomment -%}
            {%- if product.available -%}
              <div class="kn-qa__frame">
                <button
                  type="button"
                  class="kn-qa__open"
                  data-kn-qa-open="kn-qa-{{ product.id }}"
                  aria-haspopup="dialog"
                  aria-label="{{ kn_qa_title | escape }} : {{ product.title | escape }}"
                >
                  {%- render 'kn-icon', name: 'cart', size: 20 -%}
                </button>
              </div>
            {%- endif -%}
          </div>
        {%- endfor -%}
      </div>

      {%- comment -%}
        Un panneau par produit, posé après la grille : un dialogue natif passe
        au premier plan quoi qu'il y ait autour. Le formulaire est celui
        d'Horizon (comme sur la fiche produit), donc le tiroir panier et le
        compteur de l'en-tête se mettent à jour tout seuls.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- for product in kn_products limit: s.count -%}
        {%- if product.available -%}
          {%- assign kn_variant = product.selected_or_first_available_variant -%}
          <dialog
            class="kn-qa__panel"
            id="kn-qa-{{ product.id }}"
            aria-labelledby="kn-qa-heading-{{ product.id }}"
          >
            <div class="kn-qa__sheet" data-kn-surface="light">
              <div class="kn-qa__head">
                <h3 class="kn-qa__heading" id="kn-qa-heading-{{ product.id }}">{{ kn_qa_title | escape }}</h3>
                <button
                  type="button"
                  class="kn-qa__close"
                  data-kn-qa-close
                  aria-label="{{ kn_qa_close | escape }}"
                >
                  {%- render 'kn-icon', name: 'close', size: 20 -%}
                </button>
              </div>

              <div class="kn-qa__item">
                {%- if product.featured_image != blank -%}
                  {%- assign kn_alt = product.featured_image.alt | default: product.title -%}
                  <div class="kn-qa__media">
                    {{
                      product.featured_image
                      | image_url: width: 400
                      | image_tag:
                        loading: 'lazy',
                        widths: '200,400',
                        sizes: '120px',
                        alt: kn_alt
                    }}
                  </div>
                {%- endif -%}
                <div class="kn-qa__info">
                  <p class="kn-qa__name">{{ product.title | escape }}</p>
                  <p class="kn-qa__price">{{ product.price | money }}</p>
                </div>
              </div>

              <product-form-component
                id="KnQaForm-{{ product.id }}"
                class="kn-qa__form"
                data-section-id="{{ section.id }}"
                data-product-id="{{ product.id }}"
                data-quantity-default="1"
                on:submit="/handleSubmit"
              >
                <div class="kn-visually-hidden" aria-live="assertive" aria-atomic="true" ref="liveRegion"></div>

                {%- assign kn_form_id = 'KnQaFormEl-' | append: product.id -%}
                {%- form 'product', product, id: kn_form_id, data-type: 'add-to-cart-form' -%}
                  <input type="hidden" name="id" ref="variantId" value="{{ kn_variant.id }}">
                  <input type="hidden" name="quantity" value="1">
                  {%- if product.metafields.custom.precommande.value == true -%}
                    <input type="hidden" name="properties[{{ 'kinu.preorder.property' | t }}]" value="{{ 'kinu.preorder.property_value' | t }}">
                  {%- endif -%}

                  {%- unless product.has_only_default_variant -%}
                    {%- for option in product.options_with_values -%}
                      {%- assign kn_option_index = forloop.index0 -%}
                      <div class="kn-qa__field">
                        <label class="kn-label kn-qa__label" for="kn-qa-option-{{ product.id }}-{{ kn_option_index }}">
                          {{- option.name | escape -}}
                        </label>
                        <div class="kn-qa__select-wrap">
                          <select
                            class="kn-qa__select"
                            id="kn-qa-option-{{ product.id }}-{{ kn_option_index }}"
                            data-kn-qa-option
                          >
                            {%- for value in option.values -%}
                              <option value="{{ value | escape }}"{% if kn_variant.options[kn_option_index] == value %} selected{% endif %}>
                                {{- value | escape -}}
                              </option>
                            {%- endfor -%}
                          </select>
                          <span class="kn-qa__caret" aria-hidden="true">
                            {%- render 'kn-icon', name: 'chevron', size: 18 -%}
                          </span>
                        </div>
                      </div>
                    {%- endfor -%}
                  {%- endunless -%}

                  <add-to-cart-component
                    class="kn-qa__atc"
                    data-add-to-cart-animation="false"
                    ref="addToCartButtonContainer"
                  >
                    <button
                      type="submit"
                      name="add"
                      class="kn-btn kn-btn--primary kn-qa__button"
                      ref="addToCartButton"
                      on:click="/handleClick"
                      data-kn-qa-submit
                      data-label-add="{{ kn_qa_add | escape }}"
                      data-label-sold-out="{{ kn_qa_sold | escape }}"
                    >
                      <span data-kn-qa-label>{{ kn_qa_add | escape }}</span>
                    </button>
                  </add-to-cart-component>

                  <span class="kn-qa__error hidden" ref="addToCartTextError">
                    <span class="kn-qa__error-mark" aria-hidden="true">!</span>
                  </span>
                {%- endform -%}

                <script type="application/json" data-kn-qa-variants>
                  [
                    {%- for variant in product.variants -%}
                      {%- liquid
                        assign kn_vimg = ''
                        if variant.featured_image != blank
                          assign kn_vimg = variant.featured_image | image_url: width: 400
                        endif
                      -%}
                      {"id": {{ variant.id }}, "available": {{ variant.available | json }}, "options": {{ variant.options | json }}, "image": {{ kn_vimg | json }}}{% unless forloop.last %},{% endunless %}
                    {%- endfor -%}
                  ]
                </script>
              </product-form-component>
            </div>
          </dialog>
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endfor -%}
    {%- else -%}
      <div class="kn-home-empty">
        <p class="kn-lead">{{ s.empty_text | escape }}</p>
        {%- if s.empty_link_label != blank -%}
          <a class="kn-btn kn-btn--secondary" href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}">
            {{- s.empty_link_label | escape -}}
          </a>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .kn-qa {
    position: relative;
  }

  /* Cadre transparent au format de la photo : il porte le bouton rond. */
  .kn-qa__frame {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    aspect-ratio: var(--kn-ratio-card, 5 / 8);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .kn-qa__open {
    position: absolute;
    right: var(--kn-space-2xs);
    bottom: var(--kn-space-2xs);
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 2.5rem;
    height: 2.5rem;
    padding: 0;
    border: 0;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: var(--kn-ivory);
    color: var(--kn-ink);
    cursor: pointer;
    pointer-events: auto;
    transition: background-color var(--kn-dur-2) var(--kn-ease-state),
      color var(--kn-dur-2) var(--kn-ease-state);
  }

  .kn-qa__open:hover {
    background-color: var(--kn-forest);
    color: var(--kn-ivory);
  }

  .kn-qa__open:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--kn-forest);
    outline-offset: 2px;
  }

  /* Panneau latéral, calé à droite sur toute la hauteur. */
  .kn-qa__panel {
    width: min(26rem, 100vw);
    max-width: 100vw;
    height: 100dvh;
    max-height: 100dvh;
    margin: 0 0 0 auto;
    padding: 0;
    border: 0;
    background-color: var(--kn-ivory);
    color: var(--kn-ink);
  }

  .kn-qa__panel::backdrop {
    background-color: var(--kn-scrim, rgba(27, 26, 22, 0.4));
  }

  .kn-qa__sheet {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--kn-space-md);
    height: 100%;
    padding: var(--kn-space-md);
    overflow-y: auto;
    background-color: var(--kn-surface-bg);
    color: var(--kn-surface-fg);
  }

  .kn-qa__head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: var(--kn-space-md);
    padding-bottom: var(--kn-space-sm);
    border-bottom: var(--kn-stroke, 1px) solid var(--kn-surface-line);
  }

  .kn-qa__heading {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: var(--kn-fs-h4);
    font-weight: var(--kn-fw-medium);
  }

  .kn-qa__close {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    min-width: var(--kn-tap);
    min-height: var(--kn-tap);
    padding: 0;
    border: 0;
    background: none;
    color: inherit;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .kn-qa__item {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--kn-space-sm);
  }

  .kn-qa__media {
    flex: 0 0 7.5rem;
    aspect-ratio: var(--kn-ratio-card, 5 / 8);
    background-color: var(--kn-sage);
    border-radius: var(--kn-radius-media, 6px);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .kn-qa__media img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .kn-qa__info {
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .kn-qa__name {
    margin: 0 0 var(--kn-space-2xs);
    font-weight: var(--kn-fw-medium);
  }

  .kn-qa__price {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--kn-surface-muted);
  }

  .kn-qa__field {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--kn-space-2xs);
    margin-bottom: var(--kn-space-md);
  }

  .kn-qa__label {
    color: var(--kn-surface-muted);
  }

  .kn-qa__select-wrap {
    position: relative;
  }

  .kn-qa__select {
    width: 100%;
    min-height: var(--kn-tap);
    padding: 0 var(--kn-space-xl) 0 var(--kn-space-sm);
    border: 1px solid var(--kn-surface-fg);
    border-radius: 0;
    background: transparent;
    color: inherit;
    font: inherit;
    appearance: none;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .kn-qa__select option {
    background-color: var(--kn-ivory);
    color: var(--kn-ink);
  }

  .kn-qa__caret {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    right: var(--kn-space-sm);
    display: inline-flex;
    transform: translateY(-50%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .kn-qa__button {
    width: 100%;
  }

  .kn-qa__error {
    display: block;
    margin-top: var(--kn-space-sm);
    color: var(--kn-error, #a33a2a);
    font-size: var(--kn-fs-sm);
  }

  .kn-qa__error.hidden {
    display: none;
  }

  .kn-qa__error-mark {
    margin-right: var(--kn-space-2xs);
    font-weight: var(--kn-fw-bold);
  }
</style>

<script>
  (function () {
    if (window.knQuickAddReady) return;
    window.knQuickAddReady = true;

    function refresh(dialog) {
      var node = dialog.querySelector('[data-kn-qa-variants]');
      var button = dialog.querySelector('[data-kn-qa-submit]');
      var label = dialog.querySelector('[data-kn-qa-label]');
      var input = dialog.querySelector('input[name="id"]');
      if (!node || !button || !label || !input) return;

      var variants = [];
      try {
        variants = JSON.parse(node.textContent);
      } catch (error) {
        return;
      }

      var selects = [].slice.call(dialog.querySelectorAll('[data-kn-qa-option]'));
      var choice = selects.map(function (select) {
        return select.value;
      });
      var soldOut = button.getAttribute('data-label-sold-out') || '';

      var variant = null;
      if (selects.length === 0) {
        variant = variants[0] || null;
      } else {
        variant =
          variants.filter(function (item) {
            return choice.every(function (value, index) {
              return item.options[index] === value;
            });
          })[0] || null;
      }

      var canAdd = Boolean(variant && variant.available);
      input.value = variant ? String(variant.id) : '';
      button.disabled = !canAdd;
      label.textContent = canAdd ? button.getAttribute('data-label-add') : soldOut;

      var media = dialog.querySelector('.kn-qa__media img');
      if (media && variant && variant.image && media.getAttribute('src') !== variant.image) {
        media.removeAttribute('srcset');
        media.src = variant.image;
      }

      selects.forEach(function (select, selectIndex) {
        [].forEach.call(select.options, function (option) {
          var probe = choice.slice();
          probe[selectIndex] = option.value;
          var reachable = variants.some(function (item) {
            return (
              item.available &&
              probe.every(function (value, index) {
                return item.options[index] === value;
              })
            );
          });
          option.textContent = reachable ? option.value : option.value + ' (' + soldOut.toLowerCase() + ')';
        });
      });
    }

    document.addEventListener('click', function (event) {
      var target = event.target;
      if (!(target instanceof Element)) return;

      var opener = target.closest('[data-kn-qa-open]');
      if (opener) {
        var dialog = document.getElementById(opener.getAttribute('data-kn-qa-open'));
        if (dialog && typeof dialog.showModal === 'function') {
          refresh(dialog);
          dialog.showModal();
        }
        return;
      }

      if (target.closest('[data-kn-qa-close]')) {
        var current = target.closest('dialog');
        if (current) current.close();
        return;
      }

      // Clic sur le voile : la cible est le dialogue lui-même, jamais son contenu.
      if (target instanceof HTMLDialogElement && target.classList.contains('kn-qa__panel')) {
        target.close();
      }
    });

    document.addEventListener('change', function (event) {
      var target = event.target;
      if (!(target instanceof Element) || !target.hasAttribute('data-kn-qa-option')) return;
      var dialog = target.closest('dialog');
      if (dialog) refresh(dialog);
    });

    // Une fois la pièce ajoutée, le panneau se ferme et laisse place au tiroir panier.
    document.addEventListener('submit', function (event) {
      var form = event.target;
      if (!(form instanceof Element) || !form.closest('.kn-qa__panel')) return;
      window.setTimeout(function () {
        var dialog = form.closest('dialog');
        if (dialog && dialog.open) dialog.close();
      }, 0);
    });
  })();
</script>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Nouveautés",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "kn-products-section",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "title",
      "label": "Titre",
      "default": "Nouveautés"
    },
    {
      "type": "collection",
      "id": "collection",
      "label": "Collection affichée",
      "info": "Si aucune collection n'est choisie : les dernières pièces créées, de la plus récente à la plus ancienne. Une collection choisie garde son propre ordre."
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "count",
      "label": "Nombre de produits",
      "min": 4,
      "max": 12,
      "step": 2,
      "default": 8
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "link_label",
      "label": "Libellé du lien de la collection",
      "default": "Voir tout"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Ajout rapide (icône panier)"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "quick_add_title",
      "label": "Titre du panneau",
      "info": "Vide : « Ajout rapide » en français, « Quick add » dans les autres langues."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "quick_add_label",
      "label": "Libellé du bouton d'ajout",
      "info": "Vide : le libellé du thème, traduit dans chaque langue."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "quick_add_sold_out",
      "label": "Libellé quand la taille est épuisée",
      "info": "Vide : le libellé du thème, traduit dans chaque langue."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "quick_add_close",
      "label": "Libellé du bouton de fermeture",
      "info": "Vide : le libellé du thème, traduit dans chaque langue."
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Quand la collection est vide"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "empty_text",
      "label": "Phrase affichée",
      "default": "Les nouveautés de la saison arrivent très bientôt."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "empty_link_label",
      "label": "Libellé du bouton",
      "default": "Voir tous les produits"
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "KINŪ — Nouveautés"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}